/*!
    \page developer-guide.html
    \title Developer Guide

    This part of the documentation is for people who work on Creature Wars itself. The
    tutorial explains how the game came together. The guide is the reference you come back
    to when you build it, change it or add content.

    \list
        \li \l {Building and Running} covers the SDK, CMake options, tests and the docs.
        \li \l {Architecture} explains the layers, threads and the flow of commands and events.
        \li \l {Coding Conventions} lists the rules for C++, QML, graphics and commits.
        \li \l {Recipes} shows how to add creatures, races, research and art.
    \endlist
